meta {
  name: Paid Order
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  The whole payment life cycle without a browser: an admin creates a Stripe payment link, the Stripe webhook is
  simulated with a correctly signed event, and the customer reads the receipt. Needs a real Stripe test key
  (STRIPE_API_KEY) and STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET on the service, with the same secret in the `stripeWebhookSecret`
  environment variable. Run Auth first, and the requests here top to bottom.
}
